pre;\"></span>5</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/ai.html\" target=\"_blank\">老爸ài人陪</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>7</span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sio招來看戲</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">紀品志<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/puah-kiaukap.html\" target=\"_blank\">曾文溪電台陳雷小說廣播劇</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/puah-kiaukap.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span>——講〈Pua̍h-kiáu出頭天〉kap</span><span>陳雷創作手路</span></a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">8</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心內話</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳春美<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/blog-post_95.html\" target=\"_blank\">救肺散</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>10</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">杜易融<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/blog-post_34.html\" target=\"_blank\">菜鳥仔老爸出任務</a><br />11</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">東北仔<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/blog-post_41.html\" target=\"_blank\">三隻鳥仔</a><br />13</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雁&nbsp; &nbsp; 翎<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/blog-post_52.html\" target=\"_blank\">扮公伙仔</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>17</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">夏玉華<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/e_22.html\" target=\"_blank\">難忘ê形影</a><br />19</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">林秋雲<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/blog-post_83.html\" target=\"_blank\">出&nbsp; &nbsp; 世</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">20</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／張雅淳、陳瀅安&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／吳宛霖<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/kapsio-lam.html\" target=\"_blank\">月琴民謠kap當代舞sio-lām</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>22</span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">A-sim<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/kap_25.html\" target=\"_blank\">〈望春風〉、〈雨夜花〉kap</a></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/kap_25.html\" target=\"_blank\">當代同志</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>24</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Âng Hiok-siông<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2023/08/blog-post_25.html\" target=\"_blank\">做伙來參與民防</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>26</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳昭蓉<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/ekah.html\" target=\"_blank\">獨居老人ê自尊kah悲哀</a><br />28</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">生活ê藝術</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">侯岱君<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/ma-la-song.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ma-lá-sóng人生</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>30</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">林芊妗<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/e_28.html\" target=\"_blank\">厝邊ê田園素材庫</a><br />32</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">光景bóng uē</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">駱寶雲<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/kaie.html\" target=\"_blank\">我上kài留戀ê所在</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>33</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tân Lō͘<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/pe-po-ku-lo-kia-tah-te-2-pha-pha.html\" target=\"_blank\">Pêⁿ-po͘ Kū-lō͘ Kiâⁿ-ta̍h (Tē-2 Pha)</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/pe-po-ku-lo-kia-tah-te-2-pha-pha.html\" target=\"_blank\">平埔舊路行踏（第二pha）</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">35</span></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳碧俞<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/a_28.html\" target=\"_blank\">菊--à姨婆（二）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>38</span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3 style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌</span></h3><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳&nbsp; &nbsp; 雷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/m.html\" target=\"_blank\">台灣文化m̄是中國文化</a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/08/m.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span>Tâi-oân Bûn-hòa M̄ Sī Tiong-kok&nbsp;</span><span>Bûn-hòa</span></a></span></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">42</span></span></div><div><br /></div></div><div><br /></div></div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><div><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><br /></div></div></span></div><div><span><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg9lB8KPAa-mX-DHM_4hXyjrJSEg